摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Small, independently installable plugins for DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1355954142","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugins","slug":"klarkxy/dsh-plugins","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","session-management","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Small, independently installable plugins for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文 / English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugins by klarkxy. Browse them on the plugin site, which shows install comma"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"nds and each plugin's documentation."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Plugins"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Package | What it does |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| `@klarkxy/dsh-current-title` | Auto Title: session titles follow the latest task automatically; na"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"mes you set by hand stay put. Auto-rename and manual naming coexist. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-git-commit` |"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" Git Commit: commit workspace changes from the conversation, with the model grouping commits and gen"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"erating commit messages. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-delegation` | Delegation Mode: per-session switch where t"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"he main agent plans, delegates, and reviews while subagents carry out the work, enabling multi-agent"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" orchestration. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-safe-auto` | Safe Auto: adds a Safe Auto approval level where a re"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"viewer model answers approval requests one call at a time, with full review history and audit trails"},{"id":"p7s8","text":". |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-session-manager` | Session Manager: search and read DeepSeek Harness sessions ac"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"ross working directories, use temporary workspaces, continue with one tap or automatically when a re"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ply stops early, recap on return with context-compaction hints, and optionally let the agent fork th"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"e current session or message other sessions. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-model-hub` | Subagents: configure the"},{"id":"p7s12","text":" model and reasoning effort for new subagents, and see their last-used model in the conversation pop"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"up. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-magpie` | Magpie: connect DSH to a Magpie gateway on this computer, your local"},{"id":"p7s14","text":" network or elsewhere, and sync its models, default model and web search; supports local LLMs and Op"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"enAI-compatible endpoints. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-web-search-manager` | Web Search: manage and rank searc"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"h and page-reading services, including providers from installed plugins, in one settings page. |\n| `"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"@klarkxy/dsh-zhihu` | Zhihu: search Zhihu and the web, check hot lists, Zhida AI answers, Q&A;, comm"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"ents, knowledge bases, creator stats, and quotas, and manage article, question, and pin drafts with "},{"id":"p7s19","text":"image uploads. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-font` | Font: customize the interface, conversation, code and termi"},{"id":"p7s20","text":"nal fonts and font sizes of the Web GUI. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-unrestricted` | Unrestricted: a session p"},{"id":"p7s21","text":"reset that removes the limits on what the model answers and delivers complete results, only in sessi"},{"id":"p7s22","text":"ons that pick it; may get your account banned. |\n| `@klarkxy/dsh-dev-index` | DSH Docs: browse offic"},{"id":"p7s23","text":"ial DSH developer documentation in the Plugins page; the agent gets two read-only tools to search do"},{"id":"p7s24","text":"cs and inspect plugins across the catalog, npm, and GitHub (`dsh_docs`, `dsh_plugins`). |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"`@klarkxy/dsh-plugin-kit` and `@klarkxy/dsh-model-route` are shared libraries that other plugins ins"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"n-kit` and `@klarkxy/dsh-model-route` are shared libraries that other plugins install automatically."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Replace `web` with your profile name and restart the profile after installing. The shared libraries "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"a plugin depends on are installed along with it."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"To browse the plugin list in DSH, enable the experimental **Custom Plugin Market** bundle, then choo"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"se **Plugins → Discover → Add index source** and enter:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The same source provides list updates. DSH asks for confirmation before installing any plugin."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Requires Node.js 24+ and pnpm 10."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The code is the developer documentation. Releases follow the release guide."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Plugin lifecycle"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Package | Lifecycle | Notes |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| @klarkxy/dsh-context-cleaner | Testing (`testing`) | Undergoing first-release checks; moves to Pub"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"lished after the npm archive is published and verified. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-current-title | Published ("},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`published`) | Published on npm; fixes, testing and version updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"| @klarkxy/dsh-deep-view | Testing (`testing`) | Undergoing first-release checks; moves to Published"},{"id":"p21s5","text":" after the npm archive is published and verified. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-delegation | Published (`publishe"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"d`) | Published on npm; subsequent versions follow the normal update workflow. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-dev-"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"index | Published (`published`) | Published on npm; fixes, testing and version updates keep the Publ"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"ished lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-font | Published (`published`) | Published on npm; fixes, testing "},{"id":"p21s9","text":"and version updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-git-commit | Published (`publishe"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"d`) | Published on npm; fixes, testing and version updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkx"},{"id":"p21s11","text":"y/dsh-magpie | Published (`published`) | Published on npm; subsequent versions follow the normal upd"},{"id":"p21s12","text":"ate workflow. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-model-hub | Published (`published`) | Published on npm; fixes, testin"},{"id":"p21s13","text":"g and version updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-model-picker | Testing (`testin"},{"id":"p21s14","text":"g`) | Undergoing first-release checks; moves to Published after the npm archive is published and ver"},{"id":"p21s15","text":"ified. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-model-route | Published (`published`) | Published on npm; fixes, testing and"},{"id":"p21s16","text":" version updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-plugin-kit | Published (`published`)"},{"id":"p21s17","text":" | Published on npm; fixes, testing and version updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/d"},{"id":"p21s18","text":"sh-safe-auto | Published (`published`) | Published on npm; fixes, testing and version updates keep t"},{"id":"p21s19","text":"he Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-session-manager | Published (`published`) | Published on np"},{"id":"p21s20","text":"m; fixes, testing and version updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-shortcuts | Dra"},{"id":"p21s21","text":"ft (`draft`) | New shortcut manager and extensible command palette; awaiting first-release acceptanc"},{"id":"p21s22","text":"e. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-unrestricted | Published (`published`) | Published on npm; fixes, testing and ve"},{"id":"p21s23","text":"rsion updates keep the Published lifecycle. |\n| @klarkxy/dsh-web-search-manager | Published (`publis"},{"id":"p21s24","text":"hed`)